# NocoDB token the browser uses for the polls and the survey (the NOCODB_TOKEN Actions secret in the
# deploy build). It is readable by anyone who opens the site: use a token from an account that is an
# Editor on the Non-Discrimination base only. Leave empty for placeholder poll percentages and a
# survey that sends nothing.
VITE_NOCODB_TOKEN=

# Where the site is published, for the absolute og:image URL in link previews. Leave empty for
# https://wevisdemo.github.io; set it (no trailing path) when building for another domain, together
# with BASE_PATH if the site is not served from the root.
VITE_SITE_ORIGIN=
